#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Frontend Exports"
msgstr "前端导出"

#. type: Title #
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Frontend three-tier export convention"
msgstr "前端三层导出约定"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:8
msgid ""
"Embeddable frontend content packs register via **manifest / desktop / "
"mobile** exports."
msgstr "可嵌入的前端内容包通过 **manifest / desktop / mobile** 导出项注册。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:10
msgid ""
"The unified settings window is aggregated by the registry in [`packages/"
"shell-ui/`](../../packages/shell-ui/); contract in [`packages/shell-ui/src/"
"settings.ts`](../../packages/shell-ui/src/settings.ts) (unrelated to SAP)."
msgstr ""
"统一设置窗口由 [`packages/shell-ui/`](../../packages/shell-ui/) 中的 "
"registry 聚合；契约见 [`packages/shell-ui/src/settings.ts`](../../packages/"
"shell-ui/src/settings.ts)（与 SAP 无关）。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manifest (required)"
msgstr "Manifest（必填）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:14
msgid "Path: `./manifest` — JSON-serializable metadata."
msgstr "路径：`./manifest` — 可 JSON 序列化的元数据。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field             | Description                                          |\n"
"| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `appId`           | Application id                                       |\n"
"| `displayName`     | Display name                                         |\n"
"| `version`         | Version (usually synced with monorepo root package)  |\n"
"| `supportsDesktop` | Supports desktop embed                               |\n"
"| `supportsMobile`  | Supports mobile embed                                |\n"
"| `sap`             | Optional; true satellite metadata (`relay`, `tools`) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 字段              | 说明                                                |\n"
"| ----------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `appId`           | 应用 id                                             |\n"
"| `displayName`     | 显示名称                                            |\n"
"| `version`         | 版本（通常与 monorepo 根 package 同步）             |\n"
"| `supportsDesktop` | 支持桌面嵌入                                        |\n"
"| `supportsMobile`  | 支持移动嵌入                                        |\n"
"| `sap`             | 可选；真卫星元数据（`relay`、`tools`）              |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:25
msgid ""
"Implementation SSOT: [`packages/shell-sdk/src/manifest.ts`](../../packages/"
"shell-sdk/src/manifest.ts)"
msgstr ""
"实现 SSOT：[`packages/shell-sdk/src/manifest.ts`](../../packages/shell-sdk/"
"src/manifest.ts)"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Desktop / Mobile profile"
msgstr "Desktop / Mobile 配置"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:30
msgid ""
"`./desktop` — desktop shell compile-time import profile (window spec, launch "
"mode)"
msgstr "`./desktop` — 桌面 shell 编译期导入配置（窗口规格、启动模式）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:30
msgid ""
"`./mobile` — mobile profile; when unsupported, `embedMode: \"unsupported\"`"
msgstr "`./mobile` — 移动配置；不支持时 `embedMode: \"unsupported\"`"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "`embedMode`"
msgstr "`embedMode`"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Value              | Represents                       | Sidecar required?                  |\n"
"| ------------------ | -------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n"
"| `embedded-sidecar` | companion (VRM + tools)          | **Yes** (embedded in same process) |\n"
"| `bundled-spa`      | shell-ui module (chat, admin, …) | **No**                             |\n"
"| `unsupported`      | mobile profile placeholder       | —                                  |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 值                 | 表示                               | 是否需要 Sidecar？                 |\n"
"| ------------------ | ---------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n"
"| `embedded-sidecar` | companion（VRM + 工具）            | **是**（嵌入同一进程）             |\n"
"| `bundled-spa`      | shell-ui 模块（聊天室、管理台等）  | **否**                             |\n"
"| `unsupported`      | 移动配置占位符                     | —                                  |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:40
msgid ""
"`embedMode` describes **how the shell hosts the UI**, not which Hub wire the "
"module uses at runtime (that is determined by module code: Hub RPC vs REST)."
msgstr ""
"`embedMode` 描述**shell 如何托管 UI**，而非模块运行时使用的 Hub 线路（由模块"
"代码决定：Hub RPC 或 REST）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:42
msgid "Bundled SPA: Hub provides `/api` and `/hub/rpc/v1`."
msgstr "壳内 bundled SPA：Hub 提供 `/api` 与 `/hub/rpc/v1`。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Current frontend packages"
msgstr "当前前端 package"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:50
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Package                          | appId       | embedMode (profile) |\n"
"| -------------------------------- | ----------- | ------------------- |\n"
"| `@freeanima/satellite-companion` | `companion` | `embedded-sidecar`  |\n"
"| `@freeanima/satellite-chat`      | `chat`      | `bundled-spa`       |\n"
"| Admin (`app/desktop` profile)    | `admin`     | `bundled-spa`       |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Package                          | appId       | embedMode（配置）   |\n"
"| -------------------------------- | ----------- | ------------------- |\n"
"| `@freeanima/satellite-companion` | `companion` | `embedded-sidecar`  |\n"
"| `@freeanima/satellite-chat`      | `chat`      | `bundled-spa`       |\n"
"| 管理台（`app/desktop` profile）  | `admin`     | `bundled-spa`       |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:52
msgid ""
"Shell apps: [`app/desktop/`](../../app/desktop/) · [`app/mobile/`](../../app/"
"mobile/) · [`packages/shell-ui/`](../../packages/shell-ui/)"
msgstr ""
"Shell 应用：[`app/desktop/`](../../app/desktop/) · [`app/mobile/`](../../app/"
"mobile/) · [`packages/shell-ui/`](../../packages/shell-ui/)"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "Chat: Hub RPC and instance_id"
msgstr "聊天室：Hub RPC 与 instance_id"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:56
msgid ""
"Bundled chat uses [`createSapDirectClient`](../../packages/sap-contract/src/"
"direct-client.ts) on the shared Hub RPC transport "
"(`getBundledHubRpcClient` / `whenHubRpcReady`). It does **not** call "
"`sap.attach`."
msgstr ""
"壳内 bundled 聊天室在共享 Hub RPC 传输层（`getBundledHubRpcClient` / "
"`whenHubRpcReady`）上使用 [`createSapDirectClient`](../../packages/sap-"
"contract/src/direct-client.ts)。**不会**调用 `sap.attach`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:58
msgid "`instance_id` persistence:"
msgstr "`instance_id` 持久化："

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:61
msgid ""
"Electron shell: preload provides `createFileInstanceStore(\"chat\")` → "
"`~/.anima/satellites/chat/instance.json`"
msgstr ""
"Electron shell：preload 提供 `createFileInstanceStore(\"chat\")` → `~/.anima/"
"satellites/chat/instance.json`"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:61
msgid "Capacitor: Preferences"
msgstr "Capacitor：Preferences"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "Admin: Hub REST + bundled SPA"
msgstr "管理台：Hub REST + bundled SPA"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:65
msgid ""
"Admin UI is built by [`@freeanima/admin-frontend`](../../platform/admin-"
"frontend/) and bundled into desktop / mobile."
msgstr ""
"管理台 UI 由 [`@freeanima/admin-frontend`](../../platform/admin-frontend/) 构"
"建并打包进桌面 / 移动客户端。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:67
msgid ""
"REST base: bundled pages use `window.satelliteShell.hubUrl` for Hub **`/api/"
"*`**. Hub enables CORS for localhost / Capacitor origins."
msgstr ""
"REST 基址：打包页面通过 `window.satelliteShell.hubUrl` 访问 Hub **`/api/"
"*`**。Hub 为 localhost / Capacitor 来源启用 CORS。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:68
msgid ""
"Local shell dev: `bun run dev:web` → `http://127.0.0.1:4173` (Hub must be "
"running; includes Chat, Admin, settings)."
msgstr ""
"本地 shell 开发：`bun run dev:web` → `http://127.0.0.1:4173`（Hub 须已运行；"
"含聊天室、管理台、设置）。"
